  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 702.20 Salvage yard",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 702.20 “Salvage yard” means a contiguous land area encompassing one-half acre or more, on or at which are stored or deposited scrap metal, junk machinery, or other materials intended for salvage that contain or potentially contain oil or other solid or liquid contaminants.\n\nSource. #8812, eff 2-1-07; ss by #10832, eff 6-1-15; ss by #14420, eff 11-4-25, EXPIRES: 11-4-35",
